            "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800E:links:Link:00CJ3C4HSG000:props:StringProp:00CJ3C4HSG001",
            "@type": "StringProp",
            "key": "position",
            "value": "301"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "**\"No automated rename repair\"**",
    "text": "**\"No automated rename repair\"**: misdiagnosed — a rename adds an anchor rather than replacing one, so an old reference doesn't break at rename time; there's nothing to repair, only a later cleanup once it's actually safe. See [Architecture](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4T8002).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CJ3A810G001",
      "BlockNode:00CJ3A810G002"
    ]
