    "title": "00CDC0RFDG00A",
    "text": "The `aperas://id/<ID>` and `../file#id/<ID>` link forms both resolve to the same target as the equivalent `[[Kind:snowflake]]` form does today.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77F8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77F8008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "00CDC0RFDG00B",
    "text": "A `#fragment` link whose text happens to match some block's title, but that block carries no `aperas-anchor` tag, does *not* resolve — the anchor-matching gate correctly rejects the candidate rather than treating it as a wikilink.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77F8003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77F800A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "### Slice 2",
    "text": "Landed as `verify.ts`'s steps 13-15, all three passing against the real corpus mirror:",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBZ77F8002",
    "type": "heading",
    "children": [
