  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CDGPBDKG001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "**3-way workspace split — inventory before deciding shape**",
    "text": "**3-way workspace split — inventory before deciding shape**: Starting the investigation the user asked for (\"do... the 3-way split refactor\") before moving any files, per the practice above (discussion first). Dumping raw findings here as I go rather than only writing a polished plan at the end — this doc is the scratchpad.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ5ET5Z8005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CDGPBDKG002",
