        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "checked",
        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "title": "Bare `aperas unfold <ref>` (no `--view` at all)",
    "text": "Bare `aperas unfold <ref>` (no `--view` at all): Done. `kgUnfold.ts` distinguishes the flag's outright absence (peek — no `view.unfold(id)`, no default-view bootstrap) from `--view` present with no name following it (unchanged bootstrap-and-mutate default). Verified live: a bare unfold on an already-unfolded ref left the default view's `unfolds` count unchanged, `--view default` on a fresh ref still grew it — see [Issues](../issues/treeview.md#id/BlockNode:00CE1GW638005).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG003",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CE1GW7CG007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
