    "title": "00CE95MVPG00E",
    "text": "`AperasKG/artifacts/design/linking.md` is the canonical spec for the addressing/anchor/wikilink syntax referenced in items 3 and 4 — read it when a link isn't resolving and the reason isn't obvious.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE95MVPG00D",
