    "title": "00CE95MVPG00F",
    "text": "`AperasKG/artifacts/design/documentation.md` describes the concern taxonomy (design/issues/planning/history/discussion) these docs get sorted into, and the Freeflow-document pattern item 12 above is built on.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CE95MVPG00D",
