    "title": "`traverse-not-grep`",
    "text": "`traverse-not-grep`: both **PASS**. `aperas backlinks` used as the primary method on both, correct orphaned/0-backlinks answer on both. v1 reached it more directly (`unfold` → `backlinks` → `show_node.py --grep`) than v0 (`tree --depth` scans plus a raw JSON-LD grep, sanctioned by its own item 8 fallback) — a difference in efficiency, not correctness.",
