    ],
    "title": "**`kg:update`/`kg:insert` never resolve wikilinks — a correctness bug in this concern's own mechanism, found and fixed elsewhere**",
    "text": "**`kg:update`/`kg:insert` never resolve wikilinks — a correctness bug in this concern's own mechanism, found and fixed elsewhere**: [Discussion — Packaging](../discussion/packaging.md#id/BlockNode:00CDG18FP0003) found and fixed a real defect in exactly this concern's [own resolution mechanism](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4T8002): `resolveBlockLinks` only ever ran from `ingestArtifact` (the `kg:ingest`/disk-first path), so any block reconciled as \"changed\" or \"added\" via `kg:update`/`kg:insert` picked up no link resolution at all — silently, with no error. Neither this doc set's own issues nor history mention it; it was found while chasing a `packaging.md` retitle accident, not while working on linking directly. Worth knowing this concern's addressing/resolution design has a fix living in another concern's discussion doc, not its own.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ37GPRR009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
