    "title": "## Implementation Plan",
    "text": "Batched, not fixed by the original filing order below — that plan was sketched before `reconcile.ts` was actually read, and wasn't followed as written once it was. [Open Issues](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG002) are grouped by which batch actually closes them, per [Task Breakdown](#id/BlockNode:00CF23FB1G003).",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CF23FB1G001",
