    ],
    "title": "00CF4R3C78002",
    "text": "**[Keep an active view, and keep it current](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4QG00T)** — the experiment's zero — is now realized by [A view is per-task, not per-session](#id/BlockNode:00CF4QNX00005), with the mechanics in [Comparing distant docs](#id/BlockNode:00CF4QNX00007). The finding closed in the version immediately after the query that produced it.",
