    "title": "## v1.3 additions — delta on the v1 snapshot",
    "text": "Threaded onto [the v1 snapshot](#id/BlockNode:00CF46W4Q8001) alongside [the v1.1](#id/BlockNode:00CF4QNWZR001) and [v1.2](#id/BlockNode:00CF5ZE1S0001) deltas. Retires the mechanical read-side gate — built, tested, and found fragile in three ways — in favor of a one-time consent question the skill asks itself, remembered rather than enforced.",
