        "value": "true"
      }
    ],
    "title": "00CGA5QBRR003",
    "text": "Add the read-side substitution rule at Orientation — [issue](../issues/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CFA7PQ1R001) — directly under \"Traversal is the primary mode of work\", stating that an `artifacts/**.md` path about to become an argument to `Read`/`grep`/`find`/`cat` is a node reference and `aperas unfold <ref>` is what it meant, and naming the two things deliberately not over the line: `Apeiron/*.jsonld` is the source mirror, and source code is not in the graph at all.",
