      }
    ],
    "title": "00CGA5QBSG000",
    "text": "State the content-case corollary at Philosophy — [issue](../issues/aperas-skill.md#id/BlockNode:00CFA7PQ20001) — as the consequence of the existing sentence that a node's meaning is constituted by what it links to, what links back, and where it sits, so the point lands as a repair of that thread rather than a new claim. Keep it at that level: Mechanics' \"grep the raw store directly\" is already its concrete instance and stays where it is.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CFAMC7XR000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
