    "title": "**Every live Open Issue reviewed and ranked by how much it hinders graph *edit* specifically — a fix-order recommendation, not yet a decision**",
    "text": "**Every live Open Issue reviewed and ranked by how much it hinders graph *edit* specifically — a fix-order recommendation, not yet a decision**: covers `issues/{core,linking,treeview,list-consumption,archive-migration}.md` (`cli`/`packaging`/`documentation`/`aperas-skill` are all empty). The criterion: does it silently corrupt or lose content on an ordinary write, does it undermine trust in what the write-verification tooling reports, or does it block a legitimate write outright — ranked above anything read-side, cosmetic, or process-only, regardless of how it's currently ordered in its own doc.",
