    "title": "**Tier 3 — blocks a whole class of write entirely, but narrower or larger in scope**",
    "text": "**Tier 3 — blocks a whole class of write entirely, but narrower or larger in scope**: [Folder/Artifact-tier holders have no promotion channel](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG009) — makes the graph-first \"create a new artifact from nothing\" path fully unusable above Block-tier; architecturally significant but a real feature to build, not a small patch. [A multi-artifact `kg:ingest` isn't transactional](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG008) — same \"partial write, no rollback\" shape as Tier 1's item 2, one layer up, but scoped to bulk ingest rather than everyday single-node edits.",
