    "title": "**Tier 4 — real but scoped or cosmetic**",
    "text": "**Tier 4 — real but scoped or cosmetic**: [`matchLeftoverByAbstract` is position-sensitive](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG005) mainly hits rename detection, a less frequent operation. [Inserting a list item always spawns a fresh run-leader](../issues/list-consumption.md#id/BlockNode:00CE32GRZG002) is a rendering artifact (spurious blank line), not data loss. [A fully-dead container is never itself tombstoned](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CF1WZ4JG006) is pure GC hygiene.",
