    "@id": "BlockNode:00CGGNFG50007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Recommended order following straight from this",
    "text": "Recommended order following straight from this: the shared reconcile-matching fix first (Tier 1's three-for-one), then the title/children `update` fix (Tier 1, proven danger, well-scoped), then the `0 changed` reporting fix (Tier 2, cheap, raises trust in verifying everything after it), then `extractAnchorNames`'s code-span exclusion (Tier 2, contained, same shape as this session's own `findLeadInColonOffset` fix), then the two transactionality/holder-promotion items (Tier 3, larger efforts) — Tier 4/5 only once those are clear.",
