    "title": "00CGJKPSD0002",
    "text": "**1. `aperas update` never re-derives a non-heading title, and can tombstone children** ([issues/linking.md](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CGFE4SV0002)): `runUpdate`'s local `title` only gets assigned in the heading-target/heading-input branch. Fix: in the `firstChild?.type === 'paragraph'` branch, also read `title = firstChild.title` (already computed by the parser for every paragraph via `extractLeadInTitle` — nothing new to compute, just wire it through) and thread it into `newShape.title`/`--text-only`'s title assignment the same way the heading branch already does.",
