    "tombstonedAt": "2026-09-15T07:19:51.492Z",
    "title": "**Fix — a props-only change reports as `0 changed`, found outside this plan's original scope**",
    "text": "**Fix — a props-only change reports as `0 changed`, found outside this plan's original scope**: [issues/core.md](../issues/core.md#id/BlockNode:00CFATMWY0001) — `headingChanged` compared only heading `text`/`title`, never `props`, and never ran for non-heading matched pairs at all. Generalized into a `pairChanged` check applied to every matched pair regardless of type. Surfaced during the same `reconcile.ts` investigation as items 1/2 above, sharing the exact reporting machinery, so fixed in the same pass rather than filed separately and deferred.",
