    "title": "**Links silently fail to persist or resolve, via at least three distinct mechanisms found so far, with nothing detecting any of them automatically on its own**",
    "text": "**Links silently fail to persist or resolve, via at least three distinct mechanisms found so far, with nothing detecting any of them automatically on its own**: a claim's `.links` field can go empty (or never populate) while every other signal — the write's own summary line, the projected markdown, a plain `unfold` preview — looks completely normal, since nothing renders `.links` by default and no command reports \"this claim's provenance just went missing.\" Three confirmed instances below, unrelated causes at the surface: (1) and (3) turned out to share one root cause, now fixed; (2) alone remains open, with no fix direction yet.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CDBYV5A8002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode:00CGN6GJV8001",
      "BlockNode:00CGN6GJV8002",
