    "@id": "BlockNode:00CGMZAPCR002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "title": "Status",
    "text": "Status: **v2.1** — four levels, Philosophy through Mechanics, each item explaining a consequence of the one above it. Only current, verified items appear here; superseded material, unverified hypotheses and version-by-version rationale live in `discussion/aperas-skill.md`'s snapshot and deltas. Concern docs: `AperasKG/artifacts/{design,issues,planning,history,discussion}/aperas-skill.md`.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CGMZAPCR001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CGN6GJV8001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "tombstonedAt": "2026-09-15T09:48:20.644Z",
    "title": "**Links silently fail to persist or resolve, via at least two distinct mechanisms this session, with nothing detecting either one automatically**",
    "text": "**Links silently fail to persist or resolve, via at least two distinct mechanisms this session, with nothing detecting either one automatically**: a claim's `.links` field can go empty (or never populate) while every other signal — the write's own summary line, the projected markdown, a plain `unfold` preview — looks completely normal, since nothing renders `.links` by default and no command reports \"this claim's provenance just went missing.\" Two confirmed instances below, unrelated causes, plus the shared fix direction neither has yet.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CGMWQ6T0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
