            "value": "12"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "title": "### Mechanics — the run-leader cosmetic issue is fixed for the common case",
    "text": "Supersedes: [v2's own \"known cosmetic consequence\" note](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613WG00B)",
