    "title": "## Open Questions",
    "text": "No concern-scope open question beyond the one live investigation gap already tracked in [issues/linking.md's Open Issues](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CGN6GJV8003): a link that resolves and reports success can still end up with an empty `.links`, with no reproduction found yet.",
