    "title": "**Scope**",
    "text": "**Scope**: `linking` owns the internal cross-reference syntax (wikilink/anchor addressing, `[[deep-path]]`, node-ID vs slug-path) and its resolution mechanics. The design lives in [design/linking.md](../design/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV4T8002); the record of what's been found and fixed accumulates in [issues/linking.md's Resolved section](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800A), not here — this doc holds the investigation, not its crystallized outcome.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ37GPRR006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ37GPRR008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "links": [
      {
