    "title": "**Motivating case**",
    "text": "**Motivating case**: [discussion/linking.md's Freeflow](../discussion/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CJ37GPRR009) holds 16 `##` headings that were moved under a `## Freeflow` heading, which markdown cannot nest — re-parsed from its own projection that section has zero children and all 16 read as siblings. Converting them to lead-in-term `listItem`s is what makes the grouping structural rather than only intended, since list items nest by indentation with no H6 ceiling — the same argument [issues/linking.md's \"Heading-in-list\"](../issues/linking.md#id/BlockNode:00CDBYV5A800C) already settled for titles. All 43 real citations into those 16 use `#id/BlockNode:` fragments, so they survive the conversion untouched.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ4H44J8001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
  {
