    "title": "## v2.7 additions — delta on the v2 snapshot",
    "text": "Threaded onto [the v2 snapshot](#id/BlockNode:00CGF613VR001). A block's `type` — heading depth included — became changeable in place, closing the last case where *Preserve identity* had no identity-preserving route and `remove` + `insert` was the only option. Built and verified the same session it was designed (discussion/core.md's own working record).",
