        "value": "false"
      },
      {
        "@id": "BlockNode:00CJ69H0T0001:props:StringProp:00CJ69H2W0001",
        "@type": "StringProp",
        "key": "startIndex",
        "value": "1"
      }
    ],
    "title": "**Whether the tree renderer surfaces every position of a multi-position `Link`**",
    "text": "**Whether the tree renderer surfaces every position of a multi-position `Link`**: the graph carries one `position` per occurrence, but whether `aperas tree --view` renders such a link once or once per position is unchecked. A renderer question rather than a model one, and the webapp's endnote back-references need the same answer.",
    "parent": "BlockNode:00CJ2TESY0001",
    "type": "listItem",
    "children": []
  },
